{
 "about": "The drawn film's voice-over, written by Muse Spark from docs/CHIP-FILM.md and the shot list; checked by viz/drawn/voice.py (V1 to V3).",
 "lines": [
  {
   "shot": "0-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "This is a grain of sand.",
   "from": 0.5,
   "to": 3.0,
   "note": "warm, intimate whisper"
  },
  {
   "shot": "0-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "By the end of this film, it will be thinking.",
   "from": 4.1,
   "to": 7.8,
   "note": "warm, promising lift"
  },
  {
   "shot": "1-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "A beach is mostly quartz, but chips start from something cleaner:",
   "from": 8.2,
   "to": 12.5,
   "note": "warm, explanatory"
  },
  {
   "shot": "1-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "quartz rock, dug out of the ground.",
   "from": 13.2,
   "to": 16.0,
   "note": "warm, grounded"
  },
  {
   "shot": "1-3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "It is silicon locked to oxygen.",
   "from": 18.1,
   "to": 20.5,
   "note": "warm, clear"
  },
  {
   "shot": "1-3",
   "who": "grain",
   "text": "These twins are mine!",
   "from": 20.6,
   "to": 21.9,
   "note": "proud, clinging"
  },
  {
   "shot": "2-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Heat it with carbon, hotter than lava,",
   "from": 22.2,
   "to": 24.9,
   "note": "warm, rising heat"
  },
  {
   "shot": "2-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "and the carbon steals the oxygen.",
   "from": 26.1,
   "to": 28.5,
   "note": "warm, dramatic"
  },
  {
   "shot": "2-2",
   "who": "grain",
   "text": "Hey! Give them back!",
   "from": 28.6,
   "to": 29.9,
   "note": "outraged, small voice"
  },
  {
   "shot": "2-3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Grey silicon is left behind.",
   "from": 30.2,
   "to": 32.5,
   "note": "warm, soft fall"
  },
  {
   "shot": "3-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "So the silicon becomes a gas,",
   "from": 34.1,
   "to": 36.5,
   "note": "warm, airy"
  },
  {
   "shot": "3-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "is distilled again and again,",
   "from": 38.2,
   "to": 40.2,
   "note": "warm, rhythmic"
  },
  {
   "shot": "3-3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "and freezes back into solid rods.",
   "from": 42.2,
   "to": 44.6,
   "note": "warm, settling"
  },
  {
   "shot": "4-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Now the atoms have to line up.",
   "from": 46.2,
   "to": 48.9,
   "note": "warm, hushed focus"
  },
  {
   "shot": "4-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Seed touches melt, pulls up spinning.",
   "from": 50.1,
   "to": 52.5,
   "note": "warm, slow wonder"
  },
  {
   "shot": "4-2",
   "who": "grain",
   "text": "Whee! Spin me up!",
   "from": 52.6,
   "to": 54.0,
   "note": "giddy, dizzy"
  },
  {
   "shot": "4-3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Atom by atom, the melt freezes onto it in perfect order:",
   "from": 54.0,
   "to": 57.95,
   "note": "warm, precise"
  },
  {
   "shot": "4-4",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "one giant crystal.",
   "from": 58.5,
   "to": 60.0,
   "note": "warm, awed"
  },
  {
   "shot": "5-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "A diamond wire slices it into discs",
   "from": 62.1,
   "to": 64.8,
   "note": "warm, crisp"
  },
  {
   "shot": "5-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "thinner than a coin,",
   "from": 66.2,
   "to": 68.0,
   "note": "warm, light"
  },
  {
   "shot": "5-3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "polished until they shine like mirrors.",
   "from": 70.2,
   "to": 72.6,
   "note": "warm, shining"
  },
  {
   "shot": "6-1",
   "who": "lou",
   "text": "Welcome to the fab!",
   "from": 74.1,
   "to": 75.5,
   "note": "booming, robotic cheer"
  },
  {
   "shot": "6-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "The wafers enter the fab in lots of 25.",
   "from": 75.6,
   "to": 78.9,
   "note": "warm, official"
  },
  {
   "shot": "6-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "From this moment on, the simulator follows every one of them.",
   "from": 79.2,
   "to": 83.5,
   "note": "warm, watchful"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Here is the trick:",
   "from": 84.2,
   "to": 86.0,
   "note": "warm, conspiratorial"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "a chip builds like a city, one floor at a time.",
   "from": 88.0,
   "to": 92.0,
   "note": "warm, building"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-3",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "A film, a pattern printed with light,",
   "from": 92.2,
   "to": 95.0,
   "note": "warm, delicate"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-4",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "an etch, a dose of atoms,",
   "from": 97.1,
   "to": 99.5,
   "note": "warm, steady"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-4",
   "who": "grain",
   "text": "Brrr! Brave face on!",
   "from": 99.6,
   "to": 101.0,
   "note": "shivering, determined"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-5",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "a wash, a check.",
   "from": 102.2,
   "to": 104.0,
   "note": "warm, fresh"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-5",
   "who": "grain",
   "text": "Coach is in!",
   "from": 104.2,
   "to": 105.5,
   "note": "pumped, coach voice"
  },
  {
   "shot": "7-6",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Then the loop begins again.",
   "from": 106.2,
   "to": 108.2,
   "note": "warm, looping"
  },
  {
   "shot": "8-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Out comes a wafer tiled with identical chips,",
   "from": 120.2,
   "to": 123.5,
   "note": "warm, reveal"
  },
  {
   "shot": "8-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "millions to billions of tiny switches in each.",
   "from": 125.5,
   "to": 128.5,
   "note": "warm, marveling"
  },
  {
   "shot": "9-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Not every die works.",
   "from": 130.2,
   "to": 132.0,
   "note": "warm, honest"
  },
  {
   "shot": "9-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Needles finer than hair test each one.",
   "from": 134.1,
   "to": 136.6,
   "note": "warm, careful"
  },
  {
   "shot": "9-2",
   "who": "grain",
   "text": "Ouch! Did I pass?",
   "from": 136.7,
   "to": 138.0,
   "note": "nervous, hopeful"
  },
  {
   "shot": "10-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Cut along the narrow streets between them,",
   "from": 138.2,
   "to": 141.0,
   "note": "warm, gentle"
  },
  {
   "shot": "10-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "each die is finally on its own.",
   "from": 142.2,
   "to": 144.9,
   "note": "warm, tender"
  },
  {
   "shot": "11-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "A bare die is tiny and fragile,",
   "from": 146.2,
   "to": 148.9,
   "note": "warm, protective"
  },
  {
   "shot": "11-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "so it gets a home that links it to the world.",
   "from": 150.0,
   "to": 153.95,
   "note": "warm, comforting"
  },
  {
   "shot": "12-1",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Tested, sorted and shipped.",
   "from": 154.2,
   "to": 156.0,
   "note": "warm, brisk"
  },
  {
   "shot": "12-2",
   "who": "narrator",
   "text": "Began on a beach, ends in your pocket.",
   "from": 159.0,
   "to": 162.0,
   "note": "warm, full circle"
  },
  {
   "shot": "12-2",
   "who": "grain",
   "text": "This grain of sand is thinking!",
   "from": 162.1,
   "to": 164.0,
   "note": "awed, awake"
  }
 ]
}